  3. **`/workspace`** (`CustomerManagement.tsx`): `:268` `LoadingState "Loading customers..."`, the list section only when `state.status === "ready"` (`:274`), the progress bars inside it (`ProgressCell` `:60`). **TRAP: `:218` is a `<p role="status">` that is ALWAYS on the page (`sr-only` when empty), so "no `role=status` left on the page" can never be true here.**
  4. **`/customers/quollridge/documents`** (`DocumentGeneration.tsx`): `:155` `role="status"` "Loading the customer's result..." while the result loads; the preview names the customer from the directory call (`:172` `{customer.name}`), which reads "Customer" until its call answers (the same fact `dashboardData` states at `:28-30`).
